rgia&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Georgia;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nGeorgia\">6. If the Ambassador does not comply with this Agreement or does not\r\ncontinue to promote and represent Company in a positive manner or in such way\r\nconsistent with company image, Ambassador will be subject for termination in RedD’s\r\ndiscretion. Ambassador may also terminate their participation at their own\r\ndiscretion.<br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n12.0pt;margin-left:0in\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Georgia;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nGeorgia\">7. This is the entire agreement between the parties and may not be\r\naltered except in writing.<br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:12.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:\r\n12.0pt;margin-left:0in\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Georgia;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nGeorgia\">8. RedD &amp; co. holds the right to terminate this agreement at any\r\ntime upon written notice.<br>\r\n<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\r\n<!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p>",
